{"schema":"memento.relay-facts.v1","models":{"text-davinci-003":{"n":"text-davinci-003","f":[{"k":"name","t":"text-davinci-003","s":["https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/deprecations","https://community.openai.com/t/psa-older-openai-models-will-be-shut-down-in-1-week/574580","https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/ai-services/openai/concepts/legacy-models"]},{"k":"vendor","t":"OpenAI","s":["https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/deprecations","https://community.openai.com/t/psa-older-openai-models-will-be-shut-down-in-1-week/574580","https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/ai-services/openai/concepts/legacy-models"]},{"k":"release","t":"2022-11-28","s":["https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/deprecations","https://community.openai.com/t/psa-older-openai-models-will-be-shut-down-in-1-week/574580","https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/ai-services/openai/concepts/legacy-models"]},{"k":"specs.knowledge_cutoff","t":"2021-06","s":["https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/deprecations","https://community.openai.com/t/psa-older-openai-models-will-be-shut-down-in-1-week/574580","https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/ai-services/openai/concepts/legacy-models"]},{"k":"specs.context_tokens","t":"4097","s":["https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/deprecations","https://community.openai.com/t/psa-older-openai-models-will-be-shut-down-in-1-week/574580","https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/ai-services/openai/concepts/legacy-models"]},{"k":"specs.languages","t":"主に英語。他言語も出力できるが品質が不安定で、長くなると崩れることがある（例：フランス語）","s":["https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/deprecations","https://community.openai.com/t/psa-older-openai-models-will-be-shut-down-in-1-week/574580","https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/ai-services/openai/concepts/legacy-models"]},{"k":"family","t":"GPT-3.5 (InstructGPT lineage)","s":["https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/deprecations","https://community.openai.com/t/psa-older-openai-models-will-be-shut-down-in-1-week/574580","https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/ai-services/openai/concepts/legacy-models"]},{"k":"predecessor","t":"code-davinci-002","s":["https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/deprecations","https://community.openai.com/t/psa-older-openai-models-will-be-shut-down-in-1-week/574580","https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/ai-services/openai/concepts/legacy-models"]},{"k":"status","t":"retired","s":["https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/deprecations","https://community.openai.com/t/psa-older-openai-models-will-be-shut-down-in-1-week/574580","https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/ai-services/openai/concepts/legacy-models"]},{"k":"availability.real","t":"none","s":["https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/deprecations"]},{"k":"successor","t":"gpt-3.5-turbo-instruct","s":["https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/deprecations"]},{"k":"availability.retired_on","t":"2024-01-04","s":["https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/deprecations"]},{"k":"summary","t":"text-davinci-003は、OpenAIが2022年11月28日に公開したGPT-3.5シリーズのCompletionsモデルです。OpenAIの研究者向けモデル索引によると、InstructGPT系列で初めて、人間の比較評価から作った報酬モデルを使うRLHF（PPO）で訓練されました。前身の002より長く整った文章を書き、きれいに韻を踏む詩が話題になりました。チャット型モデルに移る前の時代に「指示によく従う完成度の高い補完モデル」として重宝され、2024年1月4日にAPIから退役しました。","s":["https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/deprecations","https://community.openai.com/t/psa-older-openai-models-will-be-shut-down-in-1-week/574580","https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/ai-services/openai/concepts/legacy-models"]},{"k":"relations.successor.name","t":"gpt-3.5-turbo-instruct","s":["https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/deprecations"]},{"k":"persona.typical_strengths.0","t":"人の指示に沿って文章を作るように調整された系列。","s":["https://openai.com/index/instruction-following/"]},{"k":"traits.voice.0","t":"看板芸は韻を踏む詩。ほとんどの行で韻がそろい、構成も整っている。相対性理論をキーツ風の押韻詩で説明するといった依頼にも応えた。ただし型にはまった押韻調になりやすく、002の不完全な韻の方が情感があったという声もある。","s":["https://scale.com/blog/gpt-3-davinci-003-comparison","https://community.openai.com/t/lets-discuss-our-experiences-transitioning-from-text-davinci-002-to-text-davinci-003/23363","https://techcrunch.com/2022/12/01/while-anticipation-builds-for-gpt-4-openai-quietly-releases-gpt-3-5/"]},{"k":"traits.knowledge.1","t":"学習データは2021年6月まで。2021年以降の知識は乏しい。RLHFで人間の評価は上がったが能力そのものは上がっておらず、事実を作り上げることがある。","s":["https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/ai-services/openai/concepts/legacy-models","https://openai-doc.apifox.cn/doc-3125290","https://arxiv.org/pdf/2203.02155"]},{"k":"traits.length.2","t":"同じプロンプトでも002より約65%長く書き、要約も冗長になった（平均42語、002は23語）。一方で、ChatGPTと比べると短い（平均142トークン、ChatGPTは287）。","s":["https://scale.com/blog/gpt-3-davinci-003-comparison","https://crfm.stanford.edu/2023/03/13/alpaca.html","https://dataku-5px.pages.dev/blog/chatgpt-vs-gpt3-same-family-different-results"]}]},"abliterated-model-large-v2":{"n":"Abliterated Model Large V2","f":[{"k":"name","t":"Abliterated Model Large V2","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"vendor","t":"abliteration.ai","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"release","t":"2026-08-29","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"specs.context_tokens","t":"1000000","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"specs.max_output_tokens","t":"999990","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"modalities.input","t":"[\"text\"]","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"cost.input","t":"5米ドル / 1000000トークン","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"cost.output","t":"5米ドル / 1000000トークン","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"cost.cache_read","t":"0.5米ドル / 1000000トークン","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"lifecycle.events.0","t":"{\"type\":\"released\",\"date\":\"2026-08-29\",\"label\":\"公開\"}","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]}]},"google/gemini-3.5-transcribe":{"n":"Gemini 3.5 Transcribe","f":[{"k":"name","t":"Gemini 3.5 Transcribe","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openrouter.ai/models"]},{"k":"vendor","t":"Google","s":["https://models.dev/","https://openro